    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Kennedy Estate Agents offer for sale this 2 bedroom ground floor apartment located within walking distance of Castlemartyr Village. Gort an Oir is ideally positioned adjacent to the Cork-Waterford N25 providing access to Midleton, Youghal, Cork City and Dungarvan. Castlemartyr offers all social and essential amenities from shops, bars, eateries, church and national school. Garryvoe beach is located a short 5 minute drive away offering miles of unspoilt sandy coastline, hotel with gym & spa, playground and mobile saunas to warm up after a sea swim. \r\nThe busy town of Midleton is easily accessible (approx. 10 mins drive), with secondary schools, train station and all major supermarkets. This easy to manage property would ideally suit first time buyers or equally those right-sizing given its ground floor setting. \r\nThis “end unit” offers one reserved parking space, gas fired central heating and is ready-to-go!\r\n\r\nAccommodation:\r\nEntrance Hallway: \r\nWelcoming hallway with timber flooring. \r\nOpen Plan Living/Dining Area: \r\nBright room with Southerly aspect & timber flooring. \r\nKitchen:\r\nFully fitted kitchen, electric cooker, washing machine and dryer. Tiled flooring. \r\nBedroom 1: \r\nDouble, rear aspect room with timber flooring and free-standing wardrobes. \r\nBedroom 2: \r\nRear aspect, double room with timber flooring. \r\nShower Room:\r\nWC, wash hand basin and power shower. Floor, sink and shower area tiled. \r\n\r\nNotable features:\r\nGround floor 2 bedroom apartment. \r\nWalking distance to Castlemartyr Village.\r\nAdjacent to Castlemartyr National School. \r\nReserved parking space. \r\nLow-maintenance property.\r\nGas fired central heating. \r\nMove-in ready. \r\nBER: C1.BER Number: 113110142. \r\nBuilt in circa 2006. \r\nManagement fee- approx. 410 per annum to include maintenance of general areas, block insurance and sinking fund. \r\nEircode: P25 H640. \r\n\r\nIncluded in sale: \r\nCurtains, blinds, light fittings & cooker. \r\n\r\nFor more information please contact: \r\nKyle Kennedy, \r\nKennedy Estate Agents."
      },
